{"id":263,"date":"2026-10-01T15:41:56","date_gmt":"2026-10-01T15:41:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/plastic-surgery\/","raw":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/plastic-surgery\/"},"modified":"2026-10-07T18:20:42","modified_gmt":"2026-10-07T18:20:42","password":"","slug":"plastic-surgery","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/plastic-surgery\/","title":{"raw":"Plastic Surgery","rendered":"Plastic Surgery"},"content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Plastic and aesthetic surgery can restore harmony and proportion to the face and body. MedLuxLife connects you with experienced plastic surgeons and plans every step of your stay, from the first consultation to your recovery, so you can make your decision calmly and with full information.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":313,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-1022x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor examining a woman&#x27;s face during an aesthetic consultation\" class=\"wp-image-313\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plastic surgery procedures<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":314,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover-1024x948.jpg\" alt=\"Waist measurement during a body contouring consultation\" class=\"wp-image-314\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mommy Makeover<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A combination of procedures that addresses changes after pregnancy and childbirth, tailored to your needs. It may include:<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tummy tuck<\/strong> to remove excess skin and tighten the abdominal muscles<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Breast lift or augmentation<\/strong> to restore shape and volume<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Liposuction<\/strong> for stubborn fat on the abdomen, hips or thighs<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Intimate rejuvenation<\/strong>, such as labiaplasty<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":315,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-822x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Nose marked for rhinoplasty planning\" class=\"wp-image-315\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rhinoplasty<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reshapes the nose to improve facial balance and, where needed, breathing.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cosmetic rhinoplasty:<\/strong> changes size, tip shape or nostrils, or corrects asymmetry<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Functional rhinoplasty (septorhinoplasty):<\/strong> improves breathing, for example with a deviated septum<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":316,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-918x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Body contouring markings on the abdomen and waist\" class=\"wp-image-316\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Abdominoplasty (Tummy Tuck)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Removes excess skin and fat from the abdomen and tightens the underlying muscles for a flatter, firmer contour.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Full abdominoplasty:<\/strong> an incision from hip to hip, often with repositioning of the navel<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mini abdominoplasty:<\/strong> a shorter incision for minor excess below the navel<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":317,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-1024x517.jpg\" alt=\"Woman covering her chest, breast surgery theme\" class=\"wp-image-317\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast Augmentation<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Increases breast size and volume or restores volume lost after weight changes or pregnancy, using silicone implants or your own fat. Implant position (under or over the muscle, or dual plane) is chosen according to your anatomy and goals.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":318,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction-1024x967.jpg\" alt=\"Woman&#x27;s upper body, breast reduction theme\" class=\"wp-image-318\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast Reduction<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reduces the size and weight of very large breasts. It can relieve back and neck pain, restricted movement and skin irritation, and creates a more balanced silhouette.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":319,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia-1024x832.jpg\" alt=\"Chest marking before gynecomastia surgery\" class=\"wp-image-319\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gynecomastia Surgery<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Male breast reduction removes excess glandular tissue and fat, using liposuction, direct excision or both, for a flatter, more masculine chest.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":320,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift-1024x948.jpg\" alt=\"Upper arm marked for brachioplasty\" class=\"wp-image-320\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Brachioplasty (Arm Lift)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Removes loose skin and fat from the upper arms, often after major weight loss or with age, through an incision on the inner or back of the arm.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":321,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl-1024x956.jpg\" alt=\"Buttock contouring illustration\" class=\"wp-image-321\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Brazilian Butt Lift (BBL)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen or flanks, purified and transferred to the buttocks for more volume and a natural, lifted shape.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":322,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift-1024x554.jpg\" alt=\"Thigh contour, thigh lift theme\" class=\"wp-image-322\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Thigh Lift<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Removes excess skin and fat from the thighs and tightens the tissue for a smoother contour, typically after significant weight loss.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":323,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty-1024x705.jpg\" alt=\"Eyelid area examined for blepharoplasty\" class=\"wp-image-323\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blepharoplasty (Eyelid Surgery)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Corrects drooping upper eyelids and under-eye bags for a fresher, more youthful look. Upper eyelid surgery is usually done under local anaesthesia; lower eyelid surgery generally under general anaesthesia.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":324,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"Mature woman with smooth, rejuvenated skin\" class=\"wp-image-324\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Facelift<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reduces visible signs of ageing such as sagging skin and deep folds. Depending on your needs, the surgeon chooses a full, mini, mid-face or temporal lift.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":325,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal-1024x728.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of defined cheek contours\" class=\"wp-image-325\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buccal Fat Removal<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reduces the fat pads in the lower cheeks through small incisions inside the mouth, for more sculpted cheeks and a defined jawline. Usually performed under local anaesthesia.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Liposuction<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Removes stubborn fat deposits that do not respond to diet and exercise, for example on the abdomen, thighs, arms, back or waist, to sculpt the body contour.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast Lift (Mastopexy)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lifts and reshapes sagging breasts for a firmer, more youthful position. It can be combined with augmentation to add volume at the same time.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Otoplasty (Ear Correction)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reshapes or repositions prominent or asymmetric ears. Possible for adults and for children from about five years of age.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Neck Lift<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tightens loose skin and reshapes the neck and jawline. Often combined with a facelift for a harmonious result.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your procedure with confidence<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->","rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Plastic and aesthetic surgery can restore harmony and proportion to the face and body. MedLuxLife connects you with experienced plastic surgeons and plans every step of your stay, from the first consultation to your recovery, so you can make your decision calmly and with full information.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1022\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-1022x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor examining a woman&#x27;s face during an aesthetic consultation\" class=\"wp-image-313\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-1022x1024.jpg 1022w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-768x769.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-1533x1536.jpg 1533w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery-12x12.jpg 12w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-surgery.jpg 1597w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1022px) 100vw, 1022px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plastic surgery procedures<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"948\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover-1024x948.jpg\" alt=\"Waist measurement during a body contouring consultation\" class=\"wp-image-314\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover-1024x948.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover-300x278.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover-768x711.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-mommy-makeover.jpg 1439w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mommy Makeover<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A combination of procedures that addresses changes after pregnancy and childbirth, tailored to your needs. It may include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Tummy tuck<\/strong> to remove excess skin and tighten the abdominal muscles<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Breast lift or augmentation<\/strong> to restore shape and volume<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Liposuction<\/strong> for stubborn fat on the abdomen, hips or thighs<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Intimate rejuvenation<\/strong>, such as labiaplasty<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"822\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-822x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Nose marked for rhinoplasty planning\" class=\"wp-image-315\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-822x1024.jpg 822w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-241x300.jpg 241w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-768x957.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-1233x1536.jpg 1233w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty-10x12.jpg 10w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-rhinoplasty.jpg 1284w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 822px) 100vw, 822px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rhinoplasty<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reshapes the nose to improve facial balance and, where needed, breathing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cosmetic rhinoplasty:<\/strong> changes size, tip shape or nostrils, or corrects asymmetry<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Functional rhinoplasty (septorhinoplasty):<\/strong> improves breathing, for example with a deviated septum<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"918\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-918x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Body contouring markings on the abdomen and waist\" class=\"wp-image-316\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-918x1024.jpg 918w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-269x300.jpg 269w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-768x857.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-1377x1536.jpg 1377w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty-11x12.jpg 11w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-abdominoplasty.jpg 1434w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 918px) 100vw, 918px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Abdominoplasty (Tummy Tuck)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Removes excess skin and fat from the abdomen and tightens the underlying muscles for a flatter, firmer contour.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Full abdominoplasty:<\/strong> an incision from hip to hip, often with repositioning of the navel<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Mini abdominoplasty:<\/strong> a shorter incision for minor excess below the navel<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"517\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-1024x517.jpg\" alt=\"Woman covering her chest, breast surgery theme\" class=\"wp-image-317\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-1024x517.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-300x152.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-768x388.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-1536x776.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation-18x9.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-augmentation.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast Augmentation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Increases breast size and volume or restores volume lost after weight changes or pregnancy, using silicone implants or your own fat. Implant position (under or over the muscle, or dual plane) is chosen according to your anatomy and goals.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"967\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction-1024x967.jpg\" alt=\"Woman&#x27;s upper body, breast reduction theme\" class=\"wp-image-318\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction-1024x967.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction-300x283.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction-768x725.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-breast-reduction.jpg 1355w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast Reduction<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reduces the size and weight of very large breasts. It can relieve back and neck pain, restricted movement and skin irritation, and creates a more balanced silhouette.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"832\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia-1024x832.jpg\" alt=\"Chest marking before gynecomastia surgery\" class=\"wp-image-319\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia-1024x832.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia-300x244.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia-768x624.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia-15x12.jpg 15w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-gynecomastia.jpg 1355w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gynecomastia Surgery<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Male breast reduction removes excess glandular tissue and fat, using liposuction, direct excision or both, for a flatter, more masculine chest.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"948\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift-1024x948.jpg\" alt=\"Upper arm marked for brachioplasty\" class=\"wp-image-320\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift-1024x948.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift-300x278.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift-768x711.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-arm-lift.jpg 1397w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Brachioplasty (Arm Lift)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Removes loose skin and fat from the upper arms, often after major weight loss or with age, through an incision on the inner or back of the arm.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"956\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl-1024x956.jpg\" alt=\"Buttock contouring illustration\" class=\"wp-image-321\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl-1024x956.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl-300x280.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl-768x717.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-bbl.jpg 1241w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Brazilian Butt Lift (BBL)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen or flanks, purified and transferred to the buttocks for more volume and a natural, lifted shape.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"554\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift-1024x554.jpg\" alt=\"Thigh contour, thigh lift theme\" class=\"wp-image-322\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift-1024x554.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift-300x162.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift-768x415.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift-18x10.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-thigh-lift.jpg 1294w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Thigh Lift<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Removes excess skin and fat from the thighs and tightens the tissue for a smoother contour, typically after significant weight loss.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"705\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty-1024x705.jpg\" alt=\"Eyelid area examined for blepharoplasty\" class=\"wp-image-323\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty-1024x705.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty-300x207.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty-768x529.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty-18x12.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-blepharoplasty.jpg 1295w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blepharoplasty (Eyelid Surgery)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Corrects drooping upper eyelids and under-eye bags for a fresher, more youthful look. Upper eyelid surgery is usually done under local anaesthesia; lower eyelid surgery generally under general anaesthesia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"681\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"Mature woman with smooth, rejuvenated skin\" class=\"wp-image-324\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift-1024x681.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift-18x12.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-facelift.jpg 1389w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Facelift<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reduces visible signs of ageing such as sagging skin and deep folds. Depending on your needs, the surgeon chooses a full, mini, mid-face or temporal lift.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"728\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal-1024x728.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of defined cheek contours\" class=\"wp-image-325\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal-1024x728.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal-300x213.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal-768x546.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal-18x12.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-plastic-buccal-fat-removal.jpg 1199w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buccal Fat Removal<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reduces the fat pads in the lower cheeks through small incisions inside the mouth, for more sculpted cheeks and a defined jawline. Usually performed under local anaesthesia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Liposuction<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Removes stubborn fat deposits that do not respond to diet and exercise, for example on the abdomen, thighs, arms, back or waist, to sculpt the body contour.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast Lift (Mastopexy)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lifts and reshapes sagging breasts for a firmer, more youthful position. It can be combined with augmentation to add volume at the same time.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Otoplasty (Ear Correction)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reshapes or repositions prominent or asymmetric ears. Possible for adults and for children from about five years of age.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Neck Lift<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tightens loose skin and reshapes the neck and jawline. Often combined with a facelift for a harmonious result.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your procedure with confidence<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false,"block_version":1},"excerpt":{"raw":"","rendered":"<p>Plastic and aesthetic surgery can restore harmony and proportion to the face and body. MedLuxLife connects you with experienced plastic surgeons and plans every step of your stay, from the first consultation to your recovery, so you can make your decision calmly and with full information. Plastic surgery procedures Mommy Makeover A combination of procedures [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":258,"menu_order":4,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-with-title","meta":{"footnotes":""},"permalink_template":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/%pagename%\/","generated_slug":"plastic-surgery","class_list":["post-263","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/263","targetHints":{"allow":["GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=263"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/263\/revisions"}],"predecessor-vers